# src/

Core library implementation for the Udex API. Contains the main library exports, re-exports of auto-generated protobuf code, utility functions for timestamp conversion, and context hashing logic.

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Main library entry point; re-exports generated modules (index, entry, healthz) and common types; provides timestamp conversion utilities and Error enum
- `hash.rs` -- Context hashing with SHA1, supporting deterministic hash generation via sorted key-value pairs and comprehensive test coverage
